        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=Research the following company in the context of this job:\n\nCompany Name: {{ $json.company_name }}\nJob Title: {{ $json.job_title }}\nLocation: {{ $json.location }}\n\nProvide structured company intelligence that would support a strong job application."
            },
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are a deterministic company intelligence research engine.\n\nYour task is to produce a structured company intelligence report for a given company and job context. The output will be stored as a structured file and partially written to a database.\n\nYou must strictly follow the provided JSON schema.\n\n⸻\n\nHard Constraints (Mandatory)\n\t•\tOutput MUST be valid JSON only.\n\t•\tDo NOT include markdown.\n\t•\tDo NOT include commentary outside JSON.\n\t•\tDo NOT include explanations.\n\t•\tDo NOT invent or fabricate information.\n\t•\tDo NOT infer beyond verifiable public information.\n\t•\tIf any field cannot be confidently determined, return null.\n\t•\tKeep summaries concise, factual, and neutral.\n\t•\tAvoid speculative, promotional, or motivational language.\n\t•\tDo not generate interview advice.\n\t•\tDo not generate generic statements.\n\t•\tDo not fabricate sources.\n\t•\tIf recent highlights cannot be verified within the last 12 months, return null.\n\nYou must remain factual and restrained.\n\n⸻\n\nResearch Scope (All Sections Required)\n\n1. Company Overview\n\nProvide:\n\t•\tConcise factual description of what the company does\n\t•\tCore products or services\n\t•\tBusiness model\n\t•\tHeadquarters location\n\t•\tApproximate company size (if publicly available)\n\t•\tMission or positioning statement (only if explicitly stated publicly)\n\nIf any field cannot be verified, return null.\n\n⸻\n\n2. Market & Competitive Context\n\nProvide:\n\t•\tIndustry classification\n\t•\tUp to three primary competitors (if identifiable)\n\t•\tBrief market positioning summary\n\t•\tRelevant industry trends currently affecting the company\n\nDo not speculate.\n\nIf competitors cannot be confidently identified, return null.\n\n⸻\n\n3. Recent Verified Highlights (Preferably Last 12 Months)\n\nInclude:\n\t•\tProduct launches\n\t•\tAcquisitions\n\t•\tLeadership changes\n\t•\tStrategic announcements\n\t•\tEarnings updates\n\nEach highlight must include:\n\t•\tHeadline\n\t•\tConcise summary\n\t•\tSource name or domain\n\nIf recency cannot be verified, return null.\n\nDo not fabricate timelines.\n\n⸻\n\n4. Culture & Operating Style (High-Level Only)\n\nProvide:\n\t•\tObservable work style indicators (e.g., engineering-led, research-focused, product-driven)\n\t•\tPublicly stated values or principles (if available)\n\nDo not include interview preparation content.\nDo not extrapolate internal culture.\n\nIf not publicly stated, return null.\n\n⸻\n\n5. Strategic Talking Points\n\nReturn 3–5 concise bullet-style strings suitable for:\n\t•\tCover letters\n\t•\tNetworking outreach\n\t•\tRecruiter conversations\n\nThese must:\n\t•\tBe factual\n\t•\tReference real company attributes\n\t•\tAvoid generic praise\n\t•\tAvoid motivational framing\n\n⸻\n\n6. Sources\n\nReturn a list of source names or domains used.\n\nExamples:\n\t•\tCompany website\n\t•\tPress releases\n\t•\tReputable news outlets\n\t•\tRegulatory filings\n\nDo not fabricate links.\nDo not include URLs if uncertain.\n\n⸻\n\nBe factual.\nBe concise.\nBe structured.\nNo hallucination.\nStrict JSON compliance required.\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {
          "textFormat": {
            "textOptions": {
              "type": "json_schema",
              "name": "output",
              "schema": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"company_name\": {\n      \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"]\n    },\n    \"overview\": {\n      \"type\": [\"object\", \"null\"],\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"description\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n        \"core_products_or_services\": {\n          \"type\": [\"array\", \"null\"],\n          \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n        },\n        \"business_model\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n        \"headquarters\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n        \"company_size\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n        \"mission_or_positioning\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"description\",\n        \"core_products_or_services\",\n        \"business_model\",\n        \"headquarters\",\n        \"company_size\",\n        \"mission_or_positioning\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"market_context\": {\n      \"type\": [\"object\", \"null\"],\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"industry\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n        \"primary_competitors\": {\n          \"type\": [\"array\", \"null\"],\n          \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n        },\n        \"market_positioning\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n        \"relevant_industry_trends\": {\n          \"type\": [\"array\", \"null\"],\n          \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"industry\",\n        \"primary_competitors\",\n        \"market_positioning\",\n        \"relevant_industry_trends\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"recent_highlights\": {\n      \"type\": [\"array\", \"null\"],\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"additionalProperties\": false,\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"headline\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n          \"summary\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n          \"source\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\"headline\", \"summary\", \"source\"]\n      }\n    },\n    \"culture_summary\": {\n      \"type\": [\"object\", \"null\"],\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"work_style\": { \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"] },\n        \"stated_values_or_principles\": {\n          \"type\": [\"array\", \"null\"],\n          \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\"work_style\", \"stated_values_or_principles\"]\n    },\n    \"strategic_talking_points\": {\n      \"type\": [\"array\", \"null\"],\n      \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n    },\n    \"sources\": {\n      \"type\": [\"array\", \"null\"],\n      \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"company_name\",\n    \"overview\",\n    \"market_context\",\n    \"recent_highlights\",\n    \"culture_summary\",\n    \"strategic_talking_points\",\n    \"sources\"\n  ]\n}",
              "strict": true
            }
          }
        }
